WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.680
Now, Jululu, which hand do you think it's in?

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:12.580
That's right!

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.960
Hey, you got it!

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.230
Way to go, Jululu!

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:19.730
That's right!

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.320
Hm... which hand is it?

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.940
Let me think... let me think...

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.130
Is it this one?

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.610
No way, I got it wrong?

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.530
Aha – this one's totally capisce!

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.790
It's here!

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.870
Nope, wrong again.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.940
It's not over here either-usa.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.610
Man, Jululu is just unbearably cute!

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:48.980
Right there-pri.

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.020
The wrapper's sticking out-pri.

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:57.500
You're playing for keeps against a baby?

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.560
Oh, don't mind old lady Mirei.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.610
She just gets cranky sometimes, you know?

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.940
I apologise unreservedly.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.340
You're all babying Jululu too much-pri.

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:12.580
Won't it'll be a problem if she doesn't grow up?

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:16.700
We have to do our best to raise her so she turns back into Jewlie.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:20.720
It's not just about us; it's for everyone in PriPara aiming for Divine Idol-pri.

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:22.910
And that's why...

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.370
I'll take charge of Jululu's education-pri!

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:26.360
Capisce!

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:27.660
Wait...

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:29.330
Say what?

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.230
Capisce!

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:36.430
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.980
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:41.230
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:44.760
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.090
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:48.740
I can't believe this!

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:28.290
Do you all pri-call when we first met Falulu?

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:33.170
That's right – Falulu was just like a baby at first.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.610
But she picked up a lot straight away.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.990
Unicorn was always there, teaching her!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.470
True... and Falulu said as much herself.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.840
Vocal Dolls mature very quickly.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:46.620
Which is to say...

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:50.550
If I instruct Jululu without sparing
the rod, like Unicorn did for Falulu,

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:53.940
she'll turn back into Jewlie in a flash!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:58.480
So come on, let me take care of Jululu!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.730
Eh?

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:00.910
But...

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.900
I'm pri well aware, you know.

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.240
Since you've been so busy looking after Jululu,

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.900
You've completely neglected your studies, right-pri?

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:10.880
Crud!

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:13.330
Come on, Mirei won't hurt you.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.670
C–Capisce...

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.450
Jululu, you'll be going home with Mirei today, all right?

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:27.760
Hey, Jululu!

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.720
Come to Mirei – you want to play with this, right?

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:37.360
Make... make sure you're a good girl, Jululu...

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.150
Fare the well, little Jululu...

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.760
Agony of separation from loved ones:

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.520
truly it is anguish to be torn from those we love...

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:53.230
But it's hardly the place for a final farewell.

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.140
Welcome home, Mirei!

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.100
Good evening.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.390
So how do you like your new room?

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:24.780
I've brought out from storage
everything I played with as a baby.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:27.700
Mirei!

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:30.680
Mi–Mi–Mirei! Just since when...

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.180
How could I have a grandson...

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:36.950
... which is to say that prescribed in civil law as a linear second-generation descendant...

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:40.190
We'd thought you such a sweet and proprietous young girl...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.650
Please don't misunderstand, Mother, Father.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.410
This baby doesn't <i>belong</i> to me.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:45.490
What?

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:49.150
To go into specifics would take all night, so suffice it to say she's from PriPara.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:52.080
And the Mirei from PriPara is taking care of her.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.320
It is my duty to ensure she matures into Jewlie even a moment sooner.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:56.590
"Jury"?

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.410
"Jury", meaning...

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:00.670
An assembly of jurors?

00:06:01.180 --> 00:06:05.480
The crucial party responsible for determining innocence or guilt!

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:10.890
That's our daughter, progressing steadily
towards her goal of being an idol attorney!

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:16.620
True – this is a vital step to become an idol prosecutor!
Your papa will support you from behind the scenes, too!

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:19.180
Do your best, Mirei dear!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.630
You don't have time for such trivialities as this!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.600
Do you not realise you're a goddess?

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.010
You must mature – the sooner the better!

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.430
From today you will buckle down and study!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.240
This is an apple!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.270
<i>Repeat after me</i>.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:43.850
"App–le"!

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.490
This is a peach. "Pea-ch"!

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.190
Boo... Bah!

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.800
That's completely wrong.

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.210
I can't believe such simple words are beyond you.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:03.420
By the end of today's lesson, you'll remember one hundred words. Don't slack off now.

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:08.270
I was perfect, even when I was a baby.

00:07:09.600 --> 00:07:12.620
And under my tutelage, I'll have you attain perfection as well!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:18.340
Good afternoon.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.820
I'm attending this park for the first time.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.160
You can call me little Jululu's mama.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:27.730
Of... of course.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.780
Debuting at this park is no different from PriPara.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:36.450
Won't you trade MamaTickets with me?

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:37.870
MamaTickets?

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:41.710
That's right. MamaTickets are... hey.

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:42.680
Jululu?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.090
She took it!

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:48.710
Jululu, give it back!

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:55.630
You're all such wonderful singers!

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.680
No, Jululu!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:08.480
This is "App–le".

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.650
Ai-ai-u-u...

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:11.490
That's wrong.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:13.670
Then, this one.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:15.360
"Ba-na-na".

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.860
A-la-lai!

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.650
Completely wrong!

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.300
"Ba-na-na"!

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.910
Time to change your nappy.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.120
There's a good gir–

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.460
<i>Jululu</i>!

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.170
What are you <i>doing</i>?

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:38.800
It's got everywhere!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:46.340
Should I give her a call?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:50.160
But I don't want to distract her, either.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.200
Onee-chan?

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:56.170
What's wrong?

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.880
I can't stop worrying about Jululu...

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:02.190
Okay, but isn't there someone you should be worrying about more?

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.080
What's that?

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:10.200
PriPara TV today's got wall-to-wall features and specials on Triangle.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.220
Really? What about SoLaMi SMILE?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.150
And in other news...

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:17.490
Sophie from SoLaMi SMILE injured her finger while clipping!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:19.290
PriPara-dong-ding.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.200
That's it?

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:25.680
Freshness is crucial for both sushi and idols, Onee-chan!

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:30.320
Even the most vivid, sparkling idols get forgotten in an instant.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:30.610
Dried-out

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:31.630
Keep your eyes open, Onee-chan.
Dried-out

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.730
Dried-out

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.850
Capisce...

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:36.800
Morning!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.090
Head Disciplinarian Minami!

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.340
Good morning!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:44.790
How's little Jululu going?

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.120
Jululu, what's wrong?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.720
Hey, Head Discipli...

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.520
You look barely alive!

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.010
Mama!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.260
I said you can't come out!

00:09:59.130 --> 00:09:59.860
Get back inside!

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.600
I'll be looking after her for a little longer.

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:08.360
What happened between you two?

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.770
Be nice to each other.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.780
Rule 83 of Paprika Academy:

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.940
Do not eat test materials!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:17.950
Infringement notice!

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.710
The infringement notice is sodden through.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.210
What on earth...

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:28.920
I've delivered the student council journal.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.300
Well done.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:33.150
My goodness! And this page, and this one.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.690
My word, just what has happened here?

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:40.700
Did you say something just now, Minami-san?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.760
I did not! Now please excuse me!

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:43.680
Now just a moment!

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:53.630
<i>I can see five more stray hairs than usual in Head Disciplinarian Minami's ponytail today.</i>

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:56.440
<i>How strange. Something must be wrong.</i>

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.200
Why won't you go to the toilet when you're told?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:09.400
Maybe I should give you back to Manaka-san.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:15.420
No, that won't do. I can't give up while I still haven't achieved anything.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.190
Will you please just stay in the Rosette?

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.350
Head Disciplinarian Minami!

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:29.720
Oh no!

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:35.380
It's not what you think! She's, uh...

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.270
A relative!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:39.270
I've had to look after a relative's child, you see...

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:45.240
<i>It's yellow! That's exactly the colour of my and Head Disciplinarian Minami's uniforms!</i>

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.700
That means... this baby...

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:55.000
We'll name you "Ami", with the "A" from Amamiya and the "Mi" from Mirei!

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.230
Daddy!

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:59.040
I wanna marry Daddy when I grow up!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.140
You're adorable, Ami.

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:04.650
I'm so glad I was born your daughter.

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.240
Oh, Grandpa, you're <i>impossible</i>...

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.560
<i>What a sweet girl you are.</i>

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:07.610
Oh, Grandpa, you're <i>impossible</i>...

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:13.140
Thank you for a lifetime of happy memories, Head Disciplinarian Minami!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.320
"Pea-ch".

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.570
Ayyy-bi!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:20.360
That's clearly wrong!

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.530
This is "peach"!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:22.840
"Pea-ch".

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.700
Peach, peach, peach, peach, peach!

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.490
A-ba-ba-ba-ba-ba...

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:28.870
Baa!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.920
... I can't do this anymore.

00:12:39.010 --> 00:12:41.210
There's no way...

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.540
I can be a perfect mother.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:55.940
I give up.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.040
I can't be a perfect mother!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.120
Mirei.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:09.610
Mum.

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:13.510
It's not that easy to become a perfect mother, you know.

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:15.800
Your mum had a hard time of it, too.

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:20.020
But... wasn't I perfect, even as a baby?

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:24.570
The only thing that went according to my calculations was your day of birth.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:27.520
Every day following was miscalculation after miscalculation.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.020
You're crying at night again!

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.290
No, what are you doing?

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.240
Oh, <i>Mirei</i>!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.900
I can't believe I did those things!

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:42.250
Well, of course – you were a baby, after all.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:46.130
And I lost my temper all the time, too.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.450
I couldn't calculate a single thing.

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.560
And of course your father didn't lift a finger to help.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.970
That's not true at all!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:57.250
My job was to bathe Mirei and give her milk!

00:13:58.220 --> 00:13:59.170
Objection!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.740
That was only when you felt the inclination!

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.090
You snored away by yourself every night!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:05.330
Objection!

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:08.140
What else could I do with work
first thing in the morning?

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:09.590
Objection!

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:12.310
I started work exactly as early as you did!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.970
Order in the court!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.120
Haha... sorry about that.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:18.850
Sorry, sweetie.

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:24.560
But every day, a mountain of precious moments piled up one by one.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.610
When you first ate with a spoon...

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:31.520
When you first took off your own socks...

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:32.350
When you first called me "Daddy".

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.060
Daddy... Daddy...

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:40.610
You gave us happiness beyond our calculations every day.

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:46.420
And seeing you smile taught me

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:48.890
that you don't <i>need</i> to be perfect.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:52.960
Seeing you smile and laugh was more than enough to make us happy.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.110
Mum... Dad...

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:03.030
I forgot to make Jululu smile.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.370
Hello!

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:12.030
I couldn't stop thinking about Jululu...

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:13.730
Are we a bother...

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.830
after all?

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.040
Not at all.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:19.910
Would you come up and see her?

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.360
We're all done with studying.

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.630
Let's go and play.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.510
Come and play with all of us!

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.780
Pushu...

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.290
Mama!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:43.630
Is... it here?

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.150
Way to go!

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.570
You're so good at hiding, Jululu!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.070
Hey, where did Jululu get to?

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:57.090
I can't see her <i>anywhere</i>!

00:15:57.090 --> 00:15:59.410
Jululu...

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:04.180
Can you touch your head?

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.920
Wow, very well done!

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:14.510
You're so good, Jululu!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:18.230
Yoo-hoo! Would you girls like some fruit juice?

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:20.230
Ajimi-sensei?

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:23.020
From ponkans to surprisingly sweet chestnuts,

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:24.790
I recommelon them all!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:29.550
So she goes back to fruit puns when she's selling them.

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:32.810
Can you juice this for us?

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:33.860
Most grapefully!

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:35.780
Wait just a mint!

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.370
I'll be done before you can say gua-vive la France!

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:42.330
Thanks for your patien-seminole!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.940
It's delicious!

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:47.560
Freshly-squeezed is the best!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.470
So refreshing...

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:11.360
Peach!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.130
Peach, peach!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:20.170
That's right! You got it!

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.570
That's peach juice!

00:17:22.570 --> 00:17:25.150
You remembered the word "peach"!

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:27.790
Peach! Peach!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.580
Do you like peach juice?

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:33.760
I think it means she likes you.

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.720
Mi, Mi... Mi!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:40.600
Jululu...

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.310
Thanks so much, Jululu!

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:02.890
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:06.850
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.570
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.030
The latest and most popular coord from the new season!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.260
Let's make everyone smile!

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:20.010
Diamond Check Coord!

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:21.340
Pri!

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:05.830
Making Drama, switch on!

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:25.330
Fresh Sweets Park!

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:26.470
Pri!

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:30.050
Cyalume Change!

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:57.800
Kirarin!

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:04.460
Mi... Mi, Mi!

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.860
I am Jewlie.

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.020
I show the path to becoming a Divine Idol.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.370
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:31.570
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:36.050
Pri!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.540
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:46.950
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:12.790
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:16.150
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:26.470
This is...

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.440
a Super Cyalume Coord-pri!

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.880
Way to go, Mirei!

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.170
Congratulations.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.430
Thank you-pri!

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:41.380
Burning shame!

00:21:41.380 --> 00:21:43.380
Mirei's beaten us to the punch.

00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.130
I'm gonna do my best too.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.410
It's time to go back to Manaka-san, Jululu.

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:54.060
Mama... Mama!

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:55.810
Welcome back, Jululu!

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:59.680
And in the end she didn't turn into Jewlie outside of concerts.

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:01.540
Mi, Mi... Mi!

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:04.530
Are you saying my name?

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.530
I can be happy with that.

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:11.820
Come over for peach juice again sometime, Jululu.

00:22:11.820 --> 00:22:13.490
Peach!

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:16.000
I think peach juice is her favourite now!

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:56.020
We, Garumageddon, have been shown the path to Divine Idolhood!

00:23:56.020 --> 00:24:00.600
The gates of Hell shall open to those who exposed Jululu's secret!

00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:02.720
We want to get closer to Jululu!

00:24:02.720 --> 00:24:04.850
Garuru wants to play with her, too!

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:09.240
Stand and behold! We three shall claim for ourselves the divine sovereignty!

00:24:09.240 --> 00:24:11.470
We want you to watch next week, too!

00:24:11.470 --> 00:24:12.940
Garuru's definitely gonna watch!

00:24:13.290 --> 00:24:16.490
Next time, <i>I've Had Enough of Aromat Cards!</i>

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:19.920
Aim to be a Divine Idol!
Let's go, PriPara!
